<p>Non-deliverable				 38     20     187</p>
<p>CCC						827    827     863</p>
<p>TOTAL					 15,875 13,572   8,435</p>
<p>						    HUTCHINSON AREA</p>
<p>Deliverable				 23,827 23,885   4,150</p>
<p>Non-deliverable				199    178     175</p>
<p>CCC					    3,558  3,558   1,887</p>
<p>TOTAL					 27,584 27,621   6,212</p>
<p>(Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8720)</p>
